# DorotiDemoApp ignore rules
# Every platform runner owns its local output and lock file.

[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Local publish output (for example ./publish/doroti-demo-web)
[Pp]ublish/

# MAUI / Windows App SDK packaging leftovers
[Aa]pp[Pp]ackages/
[Bb]undle[Aa]rtifacts/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.appinstaller

# In-place Blazor/_framework dumps under source wwwroot
web/wwwroot/_framework/

# Native workspace output and per-user Apple state
**/.gradle/
**/native/**/[Bb]uild/
**/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
**/.xcode.env.local
**/native/**/*.aar
**/native/**/*.xcframework/

# MSBuild / IDE user state
*.user
*.suo
**/local.properties
